      'Open a file in a minimal text editor card so the USER can edit it inline (textarea, monospace, Cmd+S saves to disk). USE THIS when you need the user to edit a file you cannot modify yourself — e.g. you ask them to add a value to a .env, tweak a config, paste a secret. Works for ANY text file (.env, json, ts, conf, etc). The user edits and saves; you can then re-read the file with Read to confirm.',
    inputSchema: {
      type: 'object',
